t changing the page.</div>\n<div class=\"frost-stat-grid\">\n  <div class=\"frost-stat\"><strong id=\"frostInspectorTitle\">—</strong><span>Page title</span></div>\n  <div class=\"frost-stat\"><strong id=\"frostInspectorViewport\">—</strong><span>Viewport</span></div>\n  <div class=\"frost-stat\"><strong id=\"frostInspectorDom\">—</strong><span>DOM nodes</span></div>\n  <div class=\"frost-stat\"><strong id=\"frostInspectorProtocol\">—</strong><span>Protocol</span></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"frostInspectorUrl\" class=\"frost-code\">—</div>\n<div class=\"frost-control-row\"><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"frostInspectorRefreshBtn\">Refresh info</button><button class=\"btn\" id=\"frostInspectorPickBtn\">Pick element</button></div>\n<div class=\"frost-subtitle\">Selected element</div><div id=\"frostInspectorElement\" class=\"frost-code\">Nothing selected.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-panel frost-v26-panel\" data-section=\"performance\"><div class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"title-icon\">◉</span> Performance</div>\n<div class=\"frost-panel-intro\">Live browser-side interface metrics. Some values depend on browser support.</div>\n<div class=\"frost-stat-grid\">\n  <div class=\"frost-stat\"><strong id=\"frostPerfFps\">—</strong><span>FPS estimate</span></div>\n  <div class=\"frost-stat\"><strong id=\"frostPerfDom\">—</strong><span>DOM nodes</span></div>\n  <div class=\"frost-stat\"><strong id=\"frostPerfMemory\">—</strong><span>JS memory</span></div>\n  <div class=\"frost-stat\"><strong id=\"frostPerfUptime\">—</strong><span>Session</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"frost-control-row\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"frostPerfRefreshBtn\">Refresh now</button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-panel frost-v26-panel\" data-section=\"activitylog\"><div class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"title-icon\">≡</span> Activity Log</div>\n<div class=\"frost-panel-intro\">Tracks Nineytone interface activity such as tab changes and settings edits. It does not record game actions.