"frost-panel-intro\">Make the interface easier to read or calmer to use.</div>\n<div class=\"frost-safe-grid\">\n  <div class=\"frost-setting-card\"><div class=\"frost-control-row\"><label>Reduced motion</label><input id=\"frostReducedMotion\" class=\"frost-switch\" type=\"checkbox\"></div><div class=\"frost-control-row\"><label>High contrast</label><input id=\"frostHighContrast\" class=\"frost-switch\" type=\"checkbox\"></div></div>\n  <div class=\"frost-setting-card\"><div class=\"frost-control-row\"><label>Larger text</label><input id=\"frostLargeText\" class=\"frost-switch\" type=\"checkbox\"></div><div class=\"frost-control-row\"><label>Strong scrollbar</label><input id=\"frostStrongScrollbars\" class=\"frost-switch\" type=\"checkbox\"></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-panel frost-v26-panel\" data-section=\"commandpalette\"><div class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"title-icon\">⌘</span> Command Palette</div>\n<div class=\"frost-panel-intro\">Press <strong>Ctrl + K</strong> by default or use the button below. Type a utility page name or safe UI command.</div>\n<div class=\"frost-setting-card\"><h3>Quick launcher</h3><p>Examples: notes · snow · themes · performance · help</p><div class=\"frost-control-row\"><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"frostOpenPaletteBtn\">⌘ Open Command Palette</button></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-panel frost-v26-panel\" data-section=\"notifications\"><div class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"title-icon\">◌</span> Notifications</div>\n<div class=\"frost-panel-intro\">Choose how Nineytone interface notifications appear.</div>\n<div class=\"frost-setting-card\">\n  <div class=\"frost-control-row\"><label>Enabled</label><input id=\"frostNotificationsEnabled\" class=\"frost-switch\" type=\"checkbox\"></div>\n  <div class=\"frost-control-row\"><label>Position</label><select id=\"frostNotificationPosition\" class=\"frost-select\"><option value=\"bottom-right\">Bottom right</option><option value=\"bottom-left\">Botto